Subject: Cantor M2B Supplied Root Topology Projection Source

Description: Raw selected build source for one pure projection that revalidates a complete supplied local-preflight record and complete supplied directory stability input, correlates their root identities and components, and preserves them beside one current-M2A-valid RootDirectory form without claiming runtime origin, physical path, enumeration, inventory, receipt, or admission.

