  + [authority_state] is preserved_source_only_after_manifest_binding

& [Purpose] is close one supplied structural root carrier
  + accept one strict identity-only projection plan
  + accept one complete WindowsPlatformPreflightRecord by value
  + invoke current ValidatePlatformPreflightForm on that record
  + require exact CompleteLocal and EligibleLocalNtfs
  + accept one complete WindowsSuppliedEntryStabilityInput by value
  + invoke current supplied-entry stability reconciliation
  + correlate exact reference, strong root identity, input-root component, volume-GUID-path component, and stable policy component
  + construct one fixed current-M2A RootDirectory observation
  + preserve the complete plan, preflight record, revalidated stable pair, and root form in one output-only wrapper
  - never: accept a bare stable pair, root identity, preflight success fragment, seed, or topology form
  - never: perform or imply physical observation

& [WhyThisSlice] is dependency ordered
  + supplied regular-file and descendant-directory carriers are complete and proven
  + M2A requires one distinct RootDirectory form with no relative path
  + current preflight records contain supplied root identity and canonical-looking volume-GUID path syntax
  + current supplied stability provides root-directory metadata seed fields after pure revalidation
  + a mixed inventory cannot preserve complete lineage until a root carrier exists
  + physical production, traversal, and inventory remain separable later boundaries

& [CriticalProvenanceRule] requires both current validators
  + WindowsPlatformPreflightRecord is public and deserializable
  + WindowsSuppliedEntryStabilityInput is public supplied syntax
  + the projection must call the current preflight validator and current stability reconciler inside the same operation
  + successful public form validation does not prove the preflight record came from cantor_windows_preflight runtime
  + successful stability reconciliation does not prove the metadata came from a directory handle or one physical root
  + the wrapper proves only the current pure construction path over supplied values

& [ProjectionPlan] is strict caller syntax
  + [profile] exact cantor-windows-supplied-root-topology-projection/0.1
  + [projection_identity] nonzero unsigned 64-bit caller-local identity
  + [entry_reference_identity] nonzero unsigned 64-bit correlation identity
  + [encoded_plan_maximum_bytes] 4096 before JSON decoding
  + unknown, missing, malformed, or type-invalid JSON rejects
  + no path field exists because M2A RootDirectory requires None
  + no mode field exists because mode is fixed Directory
  + no ordinal field exists because root ordinal is fixed 1
  + no root identity, length, digest, metadata, or provenance field exists

& [Inputs] are complete supplied records
  + [plan] WindowsSuppliedRootTopologyProjectionPlan
  + [preflight_record] complete WindowsPlatformPreflightRecord
  + [stability_input] complete WindowsSuppliedEntryStabilityInput
  + current nested limits remain authoritative
  + no bare successful fragments are accepted

& [EvaluationOrder] is deterministic and fail closed
  + [step_1] validate exact plan profile, encoded cap when decoded, and nonzero identities
  + [step_2] invoke current ValidatePlatformPreflightForm on the complete preflight record
  + [step_3] require the record variant CompleteLocal with EligibleLocalNtfs disposition
  + [step_4] invoke current reconcile_windows_supplied_entry_stability on the complete stability input
  + [step_5] require exact plan and stable-pair entry-reference equality
  + [step_6] derive the stable pre-read topology projection seed and require Directory
  + [step_7] require exact stable-seed identity and preflight root identity equality
  + [step_8] extract a nonempty final component from the already validated preflight input_root
  + [step_9] extract a nonempty final component from the already validated root_volume_guid_path
  + [step_10] require both components and stable policy component equal exactly
  + [step_11] map one fixed RootDirectory candidate
  + [step_12] invoke current ValidateTopologyForm
  + [step_13] release one complete output-only wrapper
  + first failure terminates evaluation
  + no failure returns partial successful state

& [PreflightGate] is exact supplied form meaning
  + current preflight validation must pass before variant inspection
  + only CompleteLocal proceeds
  + disposition must be EligibleLocalNtfs
  + CompleteRemote and every open, query, or observation fault variant reject distinctly as nonlocal completion
  + complete preflight record remains preserved unchanged in successful output
  - never: say the record was physically observed merely because its form and disposition validate

& [StabilityGate] is exact supplied form meaning
  + current stability reconciliation must execute from the full input
  + exact lower fault remains nested
  + successful stable pair remains preserved unchanged
  + seed kind must be Directory
  - never: accept the public stable-pair type directly

& [IdentityJoin] is exact equality only
  + preflight CompleteLocal root_identity is a current-form-valid StrongFileIdentity
  + stable directory seed identity is a current-form-valid StrongFileIdentity
  + complete values must be exactly equal
  + mismatch rejects before root-form construction
  + equality is supplied structural correlation only
  - never: call it proof of one physical object, handle, path, epoch, or runtime invocation

& [ComponentJoin] is exact and dual
  + current preflight validation establishes the syntax of input_root and root_volume_guid_path
  + this profile additionally requires each path to name a non-drive-root final component
  + input_root final component is the substring after its final backslash
  + volume-GUID-path final component is the substring after its final backslash
  + both final components must be nonempty
  + both must equal the stable pre-read policy component exactly
  + comparison is case sensitive and performs no normalization
  + a bare drive root rejects because supplied entry assembly cannot represent its colon-bearing root name under current component policy
  - never: use component equality as proof of path resolution or root membership

& [ExactRootMapping] is closed
  + [relative_path] None
  + [kind] TopologyEntryKind RootDirectory fixed by profile
  + [mode_class] TopologyModeClass Directory fixed by profile
  + [attributes] exact stable directory seed attributes
  + [identity] exact stable seed identity already joined to preflight root identity
  + [number_of_links] exact stable seed link count
  + [streams] exact stable seed stream vector
  + [length] None
  + [content_sha256] None
  + [observation_ordinal] exactly 1
  + projection and entry-reference identities remain wrapper plan metadata
  + input root, volume-GUID path, volume information, and disposition remain inside preserved preflight lineage
  - never: map preflight volume serial or path text into a different M2A field
  - never: synthesize length zero or empty-content digest

& [CurrentM2AValidation] is mandatory
  + construct only the closed fixed candidate
  + invoke current ValidateTopologyForm
  + preserve exact TopologyFormFault as a compact nested fault
  + do not duplicate or weaken root-path, kind, mode, identity, link, stream, content, or ordinal rules

& [SuccessWrapper] is output only
  + [name] WindowsSuppliedRootTopologyProjection
  + fields are private
  + derives Serialize but not Deserialize or Default
  + has no public constructor or public field
  + immutable getters expose profile, plan, complete preflight record, complete stable pair, and topology observation
  + no From or Into conversion drops lineage
  + serialization is inspection only and cannot reconstruct trusted wrapper success

& [FaultVocabulary] is closed
  + [json] malformed, unknown, missing, or type-invalid plan JSON
  + [profile] unsupported plan profile
  + [projection_identity] zero projection identity
  + [entry_reference_identity] zero plan entry reference
  + [preflight] exact nested current preflight form fault
  + [preflight_disposition] record is not exact eligible CompleteLocal
  + [stability] exact nested current stability fault
  + [entry_reference] plan and pair reference mismatch
  + [kind] stable seed is not Directory
  + [identity] preflight root and stable seed identity mismatch
  + [input_root_component] validated input root has no nonempty final component
  + [final_path_component] validated volume-GUID path has no nonempty final component
  + [component] either extracted component differs from stable policy component
  + [topology_form] exact nested current M2A fault
  + [resource] encoded plan exceeds cap or an impossible invariant fails
  + field text is capped at 64 Unicode scalar values
  + message text is capped at 256 Unicode scalar values
  + no fault contains successful wrapper state

& [Functions] are minimal
  + decode_windows_supplied_root_topology_projection_plan accepts bounded bytes
  + decode_and_project_windows_supplied_root_topology accepts plan bytes plus both complete typed inputs
  + project_windows_supplied_root_topology accepts validated plan syntax plus both complete typed inputs
  + private plan validation, component extraction, and bounded-text helpers support those paths only

& [PurityBoundary] is strict
  + deterministic in-memory transformation only
  + no unsafe, Windows API, filesystem, or path-resolution API
  + no process, environment, clock, randomness, network, persistence, database, model, or tool call
  + no Cargo dependency or lockfile change
  + no physical fixture or candidate admission builder
  + no enumeration, traversal, inventory, receipt, admission, mutation, seal, cleanup, or promotion

