  + [supplied] plan, preflight record, and stability records originate with caller
  + [revalidated] current pure preflight and stability rules execute in this call
  + [derived] root metadata seed is a deterministic transform of revalidated supplied values
  + [correlated] reference, complete identity, and path-component exact equalities pass
